==English==

===Etymology===
[[Verlan]] (or metathesis) form of {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|chassé}}, past participle of {{m|fr|chasser||chase}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|captō}}, frequentative of {{m|la|capiō||I take}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈsæʃeɪ/|/sæˈʃeɪ/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-sashay.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{homophones|en|sachet}}
* {{rhymes|en|æʃeɪ|eɪ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[chassé]].
# A [[sequence]] of sideways steps in a [[circle]] in [[square dancing]].

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

